  "process_scope": "Fourteen new actual kill-before-return cuts per tested profile, plus seven initial cutover cuts. Verify exact published marker bytes, on-disk registry progress, old-root suspension, original retry and real successor admission. Same native engine on one macOS arm64 host.",
